---
import { Users, Gift, ArrowRight, Share2, Sparkles } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section class="py-12 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="glass-card-glow rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 border border-[#38bdf8]/30 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8">
      
      <!-- Ambient background decoration -->
      <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-80 h-80 bg-[#38bdf8]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <!-- Left Column: Copy -->
      <div class="space-y-3 text-center lg:text-left max-w-2xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#38bdf8]/15 border border-[#38bdf8]/30 text-[#38bdf8] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          <Sparkles class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
          Viraal Referral Programma
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          Nodig Vrienden Uit & Ontvang <span class="text-gradient">1 Maand Gratis Streaming</span>
        </h3>

        <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Ben je tevreden over onze haarscherpe 4K streams? Deel IPTV Nederlandse met vrienden, familie of collega's. Voor iedere vriend die een abonnement afsluit, verlengen wij jouw abonnement met <strong>1 volle maand gratis</strong>!
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Dual CTAs -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 shrink-0 w-full lg:w-auto">
        <a 
          href="/referral"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-[#7c4ec2] to-[#38bdf8] hover:opacity-90 text-white font-bold text-sm text-center shadow-lg shadow-[#7c4ec2]/30 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
        >
          <span>Hoe Werkt Het?</span>
          <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4" />
        </a>

        <a 
          href="https://wa.me/18036582620?text=Hallo%20IPTV%20Nederlandse,%20ik%20wil%20graag%20mijn%20persoonlijke%20referral%20link%20aanvragen."
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 text-white font-bold text-sm text-center border border-white/10 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
        >
          <Share2 class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" />
          <span>Vraag Referral Code</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
